# Keeping node_modules out matters: COPY frontend/ would otherwise drop host-built binaries on
# top of the ones npm installed inside the image, and the frontend build fails with "tsc: not found".
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache

.git
.github
.gitignore
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

data
deploy/backups
frontend/dist
release-assets

**/.DS_Store
*.md
!README.md
